{
 "total": 115.63702947845806,
 "lines": [
  {
   "t0": 1.65,
   "t1": 3.73,
   "beat": "hook",
   "say": "There's something colder than anger about"
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.95,
   "t1": 6.28,
   "beat": "hook",
   "say": "the way this old man looks back at you."
  },
  {
   "t0": 6.93,
   "t1": 9.02,
   "beat": "ident",
   "say": "This is Portrait of Innocent X,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 9.24,
   "t1": 12.65,
   "beat": "ident",
   "say": "painted by Diego Velázquez in 1650."
  },
  {
   "t0": 13.25,
   "t1": 15.18,
   "beat": "contrast",
   "say": "And this isn't a saint with a halo."
  },
  {
   "t0": 15.78,
   "t1": 17.44,
   "beat": "contrast",
   "say": "It's a man in red silk."
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.04,
   "t1": 18.6,
   "beat": "beats",
   "say": "Old,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 19.5,
   "t1": 20.28,
   "beat": "beats",
   "say": "powerful,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.83,
   "t1": 22.0,
   "beat": "beats",
   "say": "almost tired."
  },
  {
   "t0": 22.6,
   "t1": 23.89,
   "beat": "turn",
   "say": "But look at his eyes."
  },
  {
   "t0": 24.54,
   "t1": 25.57,
   "beat": "detail",
   "say": "He's watching."
  },
  {
   "t0": 26.17,
   "t1": 27.52,
   "beat": "detail",
   "say": "There's a slight squint"
  },
  {
   "t0": 27.74,
   "t1": 29.24,
   "beat": "detail",
   "say": "in the eye on the left."
  },
  {
   "t0": 29.84,
   "t1": 32.04,
   "beat": "doubt",
   "say": "And yet it doesn't feel like holy calm."
  },
  {
   "t0": 32.64,
   "t1": 33.99,
   "beat": "look",
   "say": "Look into his eyes."
  },
  {
   "t0": 34.59,
   "t1": 36.01,
   "beat": "look",
   "say": "There's suspicion there."
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.61,
   "t1": 37.42,
   "beat": "beats",
   "say": "A cold,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 38.32,
   "t1": 38.94,
   "beat": "beats",
   "say": "patient,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 39.49,
   "t1": 40.98,
   "beat": "beats",
   "say": "measuring distrust."
  },
  {
   "t0": 41.58,
   "t1": 44.05,
   "beat": "feeling",
   "say": "As if he has already decided you are lying."
  },
  {
   "t0": 45.4,
   "t1": 48.46,
   "beat": "backstory",
   "say": "According to the traditional story of Innocent X,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 48.68,
   "t1": 52.44,
   "beat": "backstory",
   "say": "the pope mistrusted Velázquez's fame and asked for proof."
  },
  {
   "t0": 53.04,
   "t1": 56.75,
   "beat": "moment",
   "say": "And Velázquez seems to capture something few painters dared."
  },
  {
   "t0": 58.6,
   "t1": 60.12,
   "beat": "moment",
   "say": "Not a holy blessing,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 60.72,
   "t1": 62.97,
   "beat": "moment",
   "say": "but a ruler sizing up a stranger."
  },
  {
   "t0": 63.57,
   "t1": 65.05,
   "beat": "moment",
   "say": "The moment when he knows"
  },
  {
   "t0": 65.27,
   "t1": 67.07,
   "beat": "moment",
   "say": "the painter has seen him too."
  },
  {
   "t0": 68.37,
   "t1": 71.44,
   "beat": "empathy",
   "say": "Imagine seeing your own face painted this honestly."
  },
  {
   "t0": 72.04,
   "t1": 73.66,
   "beat": "empathy",
   "say": "Would you thank the painter?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 74.26,
   "t1": 76.07,
   "beat": "empathy",
   "say": "Would you hang it for all to see?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 77.67,
   "t1": 79.63,
   "beat": "empathy",
   "say": "Or would you hide it from the world?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 80.63,
   "t1": 83.19,
   "beat": "marker",
   "say": "That's what makes this painting so unsettling."
  },
  {
   "t0": 83.79,
   "t1": 85.71,
   "beat": "reveal",
   "say": "The pope is still dignified,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 85.93,
   "t1": 88.18,
   "beat": "reveal",
   "say": "but his eyes no longer seem kind."
  },
  {
   "t0": 88.78,
   "t1": 90.42,
   "beat": "reveal",
   "say": "His mouth says one thing,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 90.64,
   "t1": 92.05,
   "beat": "reveal",
   "say": "his eyes say another."
  },
  {
   "t0": 93.05,
   "t1": 95.02,
   "beat": "marker",
   "say": "And maybe that is the worst of it."
  },
  {
   "t0": 95.62,
   "t1": 98.39,
   "beat": "idea",
   "say": "Maybe distrust does not begin with cruelty."
  },
  {
   "t0": 98.99,
   "t1": 100.8,
   "beat": "idea",
   "say": "Maybe it begins with power,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 101.02,
   "t1": 102.64,
   "beat": "idea",
   "say": "then becomes caution,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 102.86,
   "t1": 104.88,
   "beat": "idea",
   "say": "and eventually turns into distrust."
  },
  {
   "t0": 105.48,
   "t1": 107.42,
   "beat": "return",
   "say": "So look at him one more time."
  },
  {
   "t0": 108.22,
   "t1": 109.8,
   "beat": "question",
   "say": "Do you see a holy father,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 110.02,
   "t1": 111.47,
   "beat": "question",
   "say": "tired and careful?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 112.07,
   "t1": 113.96,
   "beat": "question",
   "say": "Or a man who trusts nobody,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 114.18,
   "t1": 115.29,
   "beat": "question",
   "say": "not even you?"
  }
 ]
}